 class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"Header_actions__SRauh\"><button class=\"Header_themeToggle__nT4h5\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark mode\" title=\"Toggle to dark theme\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"Header_menuToggle__cfdoi\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"main-content\" id=\"main-content\"><section class=\"section\" style=\"background-color:var(--bg-primary);padding-bottom:2rem\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width:800px\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><ol style=\"display:flex;gap:0.5rem;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-muted);flex-wrap:wrap\"><li><a style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">/</li><li><a style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">/</li><li aria-current=\"page\" style=\"color:var(--text-muted)\">Creator Tools</li></ol></nav><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.7rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">Creator Tools</span><h1 style=\"font-size:2rem;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--text-primary)\">Social Media Image Dimensions for Every Platform (2025)</h1><p style=\"font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:1.25rem\">Complete 2025 reference guide for social media image sizes. Instagram, YouTube, Facebook, LinkedIn, TikTok, Twitter/X dimensions and aspect ratios.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:1.5rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-muted);align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span><strong>Creator Units</strong> — Free Tool Guides</span><time dateTime=\"2025-07-05\">Published<!-- --> <!-- -->July 5, 2025</time></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width:1200px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:3rem;align-items:start\"><article style=\"font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;color:var(--text-secondary)\"><div class=\"article-content\">\n<h2>Why Image Dimensions Change Every Year</h2>\n<p>Social media platforms frequently update their display layouts, introducing new content formats (Reels, Shorts, Stories) and changing grid proportions. Using outdated dimension guides results in cropped content, black bars, or compressed graphics that look unprofessional. This guide reflects verified 2025 specifications.</p>\n\n<h2>Instagram Dimensions 2025</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Feed post square: 1080 × 1080 px</li>\n  <li>Feed post portrait: 1080 × 1350 px (4:5) — recommended for maximum feed coverage</li>\n  <li>Feed post landscape: 1080 × 566 px (1.91:1)</li>\n  <li>Stories: 1080 × 1920 px (9:16)</li>\n  <li>Reels: 1080 × 1920 px (9:16)</li>\n  <li>Profile picture: 320 × 320 px (displayed as 110 × 110 px circle)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>YouTube Dimensions 2025</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Thumbnail: 1280 × 720 px (16:9, max 2 MB)</li>\n  <li>Channel banner: 2560 × 1440 px (safe zone: center 1546 × 423 px)</li>\n  <li>Profile picture: 800 × 800 px (displayed as circle)</li>\n  <li>End screen preview: 1280 × 720 px</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Facebook Dimensions 2025</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Feed post: 1200 × 630 px</li>\n  <li>Cover photo: 851 × 315 px desktop / 640 × 360 px mobile</li>\n  <li>Profile picture: 170 × 170 px desktop</li>\n  <li>Stories: 1080 × 1920 px</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>LinkedIn Dimensions 2025</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Feed image post: 1200 × 627 px (1.91:1)</li>\n  <li>Profile banner: 1584 × 396 px (4:1)</li>\n  <li>Company logo: 300 × 300 px</li>\n  <li>Article header: 1200 × 627 px</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>TikTok Dimensions 2025</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Video: 1080 × 1920 px (9:16 vertical)</li>\n  <li>Profile picture: 200 × 200 px</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>X (Twitter) Dimensions 2025</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Tweet image: 1200 × 675 px (16:9)</li>\n  <li>Profile picture: 400 × 400 px</li>\n  <li>Header image: 1500 × 500 px</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Check Your Images Against Platform Specs</h2>\n<p>Upload your image to our <a href=\"/tools/creator/social-post-size-checker\">Social Post Size Checker</a> and select your target platform. The tool overlays the platform's crop guides on your image so you can verify that text and key visuals fall within safe zones.</p>\n    </div></article><aside style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;border-style:solid\" aria-labelledby=\"related-tools-sidebar\"><h2 id=\"related-tools-sidebar\" style=\"font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--text-primary)\">🔧 Featured Tools</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><a style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.25rem;text-decoration:none;padding:0.75rem;border-radius:8px;background-color:var(--bg-primary);border:1px solid var(--border-color);transition:border-color 0.2s\" aria-label=\"Use Social Post Size Guide &amp; Checker — Compare and verify your graphics against visual dimensions for Instagram, YouTube, and Facebook.\" href=\"/tools/creator/social-post-size-checker\"><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary)\">Social Post Size Guide &amp; Checker</span><span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.4\">Compare and verify your graphics against visual dimensions for Instagram, YouTube, and Facebook.</span><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.25rem;text-decoration:none;padding:0.75rem;border-radius:8px;background-color:var(--bg-primary);border:1px solid var(--border-color);transition:border-color 0.2s\" aria-label=\"Use Image Resizer — Resize images to custom pixel dimensions or preset percentages with aspect ratio lock.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-resizer\"><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary)\">Image Resizer</span><span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.4\">Resize images to custom pixel dimensions or preset percentages with aspect ratio lock.</span><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.25rem;text-decoration:none;padding:0.75rem;border-radius:8px;background-color:var(--bg-primary);border:1px solid var(--border-color);transition:border-color 0.2s\" aria-label=\"Use Image Cropper — Crop images to specific ratios like 16:9, 1:1, 4:3, or custom shapes instantly.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-cropper\"><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary)\">Image Cropper</span><span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.4\">Crop images to specific ratios like 16:9, 1:1, 4:3, or custom shapes instantly.</span><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem\">Open Tool →</span></a></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-style:solid\" aria-labelledby=\"related-articles-sidebar\"><h2 id=\"related-articles-sidebar\" style=\"font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--text-primary)\">📚 Related Guides</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><a style=\"display:block;t